lly different physiologic effects on eating behavior","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/19110020/","line":18},{"title":"The time required for stomach emptying by half is 65 minutes for apple slices, 41 minutes for applesauce and 38 minutes for juice","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32805050/","line":20},{"title":"Blending a mango with raspberry + passion fruit significantly reduced the glucose (and therefore the insulin) response","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32183321/","line":26},{"title":"an apple + blackberry smoothie has about 1/3 less of the glucose effect of whole apples and blackberries","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36364827/","line":26},{"title":"small amounts of fructose such as contained in fruit can be metabolized by the cells of the small intestine into glucose","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29414685/","line":30},{"title":"*The Obesity Code*","target":"https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/1771641258/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&tag=greystonebo00-20&camp=1789&creative=9325&linkCode=as2&creativeASIN=1771641258&linkId=5634dbd0ae81ca502831b2339133b701","line":30},{"title":"Drinks that are thicker reduce hunger better, even when calories, fiber, sugar are the same","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/11790415/","line":34},{"title":"more viscous consistency fills the stomach with a gel like matrix that slows gastric emptying","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/19157816/","line":34},{"title":"perceives the thicker liquids as more food-like, which reduces hunger as much as 30%, driven by increases in GLP-1","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/22258267/","line":34},{"title":"eating semi-solids like yogurt, jelly or sour cream can reduce future food intake by 99 calories","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23815144/","line":36},{"title":"*The Obesity Code*","target":"https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/1771641258/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&tag=greystonebo00-20&camp=1789&creative=9325&linkCode=as2&creativeASIN=1771641258&linkId=5634dbd0ae81ca502831b2339133b701","line":42},{"title":"GI from 100 to 67","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/12792658/","line":50},{"title":"bread with vinegar reduces glucose and insulin spike, and people feel more full compared to eating bread alone","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/16015276/","line":50},{"title":"Lemon juice reduces glucose availability by as much as 35%","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35013789/","line":50},{"title":"whey proteins in milk and the soluble fiber in soybeans slows gastric emptying, digestion and absorptio","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/18097844/","line":58},{"title":"Dietary fat binds to the amylose in starch to form double helices that inhibits amylase","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/10917916/","line":60},{"title":"glucose effect of bread + butter was reduced by about 30% compared to bread alone","target":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0271531703001490","line":60},{"title":"Eating proteins and vegetables before the carbs reduces the glucose and insulin effect by a staggering 40–50%","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26106234/","line":68},{"title":"ational surveys indicate that people are eating later and later","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/22190135/","line":76},{"title":"65% of Americans snack after dinner","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25088521/","line":76},{"title":"Studies of circadian rhythm show that hunger peaks at about 8 pm","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23456944/","line":78},{"title":"same food is more fattening when you eat it later at night","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/22176632/","line":82},{"title":"that benefit persisted the whole night","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32229444/","line":82},{"title":"the identical meal at 6pm instead of 9pm reduces the glucose effect by 30–50%","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34371933/","line":82},{"title":"Eating dinner as opposed to breakfast also lowered metabolic rate, driving more calories towards fat storage","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26219416/","line":84},{"title":"Eating earlier reduces insulin levels and may result in an extra 2 kg","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33172509/","line":88},{"title":"early Time Restricted Eating (eTRE), avoiding the late, large meal reduced insulin levels","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35939311/","line":88},{"title":"Participants who ate earlier noted much less desire to eat at night even when asked to","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37993559/","line":88},{"title":"www.TheFastingMethod.com","target":"http://www.thefastingmethod.com/","line":142},{"title":"What are your thoughts?","target":"https://medium.com/m/signin?operation=register&redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fdrjasonfung.medium.com%2Fthe-low-insulin-diet-part-2-2-6c21ef17bddc&source=---post_responses--6c21ef17bddc---------------------respond_sidebar------------------","line":146},{"title":"\n\nSee more recommendations\n\n","target":"https://medium.com/?source=post_page---read_next_recirc--6c21ef17bddc---------------------------------------","line":152}],"metadata":{"title":"The Low Insulin Diet Part 2/2","source":"https://drjasonfung.medium.com/the-low-insulin-diet-part-2-2-6c21ef17bddc","author":[],"published":"2025-04-28","created":"2025-04-29","description":"Different methods of cooking and food preparation changes both their digestibility and their absorption, which changes their hormonal effect. For example, equal calorie portions of apples, taken…","tags":null},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"1129aqm","at":1778088456959},"key":"Bookmarks/The Low Insulin Diet Part 22.md"},
