ed in fruit can be metabolized by the cells of the small intestine into glucose","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29414685/","line":21},{"title":"*The Obesity Code*","target":"https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/1771641258/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&tag=greystonebo00-20&camp=1789&creative=9325&linkCode=as2&creativeASIN=1771641258&linkId=5634dbd0ae81ca502831b2339133b701","line":21}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
